+/**
+ * Mutable IJK hexagon coordinates
+ *
+ * Each axis is spaced 120 degrees apart.
+ *
+ * References two Vec2d cartesian coordinate systems:
+ *
+ *    1. gnomonic: face-centered polyhedral gnomonic projection space with
